$ -d test.db -e "CREATE TABLE t (id INT, v TEXT); INSERT INTO t VALUES (1,'one');"
已创建表 `t`（2 列）
插入了 1 行
! bg --hold=8000  (SQL: BEGIN; INSERT INTO t VALUES (2,'doomed');)
! bg is up: it holds the database now
$ -d test.db -e "SELECT * FROM t;"
错误：库 test.db 现在被另一个进程独占着（它正在写），连读都不行。（想等一会儿的话，加 --lock-wait=毫秒）
! exit 2
! killbg -> killed. No destructors ran, no buffers were flushed.
$ -d test.db -e "SELECT * FROM t ORDER BY id;"
+----+-----+
| id | v   |
+----+-----+
| 1  | one |
